# Google Books API key — the primary lookup source, tried before Open Library.
# Get one free at: https://console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → Credentials
# Enable "Books API" in the library first, then create an API key.
# Optional: without this key, Google Books is skipped entirely and every lookup
# goes straight to Open Library, which needs no key. The app works either way.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=
